@startuml 04-state-item
' 二手交易系统 —— 商品状态机（行为性图）
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4A6573
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FA
  BorderColor #4A6573
  FontColor #18334B
  FontSize 12
  AttributeFontColor #22333F
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  BorderColor #D9B45B
  FontSize 10
}

state "草稿" as Draft
state "待审核" as Pending
state "审核驳回" as Rejected
state "已发布" as Published
state "已预约" as Reserved
state "交易中" as Trading
state "已下架" as Offline
state "违规下架" as Violation
state "已售出" as Sold

[*] --> Draft : 新建商品
Draft --> Pending : 提交审核\n[必填项完整且校验通过]
Pending --> Draft : 卖家撤回
Pending --> Published : 管理员通过\n[审核版本 = 当前版本]
Pending --> Rejected : 管理员驳回\n[原因必填]
Rejected --> Draft : 返回编辑
Published --> Offline : 卖家下架\n[无有效预约]
Published --> Reserved : 预约成功\n[唯一占用]
Published --> Violation : 违规处理
Reserved --> Published : 取消 / 拒绝 / 超时\n[释放占用]
Reserved --> Trading : 卖家确认\n[now < 到期时间]
Reserved --> Violation : 违规处理\n[同步关闭预约]
Trading --> Sold : 买家完成\n[仅本笔预约买家]
Trading --> Offline : 协商解除\n[双方确认 + 管理员核对]
Trading --> Violation : 违规处理\n[同步关闭预约]
Offline --> Draft : 返回修改
Offline --> Pending : 内容不变重新送审
Offline --> Violation : 违规处理
Violation --> Draft : 允许整改\n[管理员审批]
Sold --> [*]

note bottom of Draft
  归档是独立标记，不是第十种业务状态；
  归档草稿对公开列表隐藏，管理员仍可查询。
end note

note right of Pending
  待审核资料不得直接修改，
  卖家须先撤回为草稿再编辑；
  撤回后旧审核页面不能再通过。
end note

note right of Trading
  商品为“已预约”时须恰有一条
  “待卖家确认”预约；为“交易中”
  时须恰有一条“已确认”预约。
end note

note right of Sold
  已售出为终态：不得修改、预约或
  恢复发布；发现违规只追加标记与
  处理记录，并公开隐藏，成交事实保留。
end note
@enduml
